      From the pristine hills of Uttarakhand to your home in India and across selected international destinations, we prepare and dispatch pure handcrafted A2 Bilona Cow Ghee and Himalayan staples with verified transparency, multi-layer protective packaging, and trusted courier logistics.
    </p>

    <!-- Navigation Anchors -->
