          Our 550ml, 1L, and 2L ghee packs are enclosed in lead-free food-grade glass jars cushioned with shock-absorbent materials. Bulk 5L family packs are housed in traditional heavy-duty steel Dolchis. In the rare event of transit damage, share unboxing photos/video within 48 hours for an immediate free replacement.
        </p>
